<div class="bg-gradient-to-r from-<%= @article.color %>-500 to-<%= @article.color %>-700 text-white rounded-2xl p-8 mt-12 text-center shadow-2xl">
  <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4 tracking-tight">This builder is completely free — no hidden fees, EVER!</h3>
  <p class="leading-relaxed">
    Just start building your resume. No credit card, no payment required.
  </p>
  <p class="leading-relaxed">
    Want to save your progress, and get the public link, and access to multiple templates, you can register for free.
  </p>
  <p class="mb-6 leading-relaxed">
    And just so you know — I'll never spam you or sell your data. 🫡 Promise.
  </p>
  <%= button_to guest_sign_up_path, class: "bg-white text-blue-700 px-4 py-2.5 rounded-xl text-sm font-semibold hover:bg-gray-50 transition-all duration-200 shadow-lg hover:shadow-xl hover:scale-105 inline-block" do %>
    <i class="fas fa-rocket mr-2"></i>
    Start Building
  <% end %>
</div>
